LetterController ..> ReissueLetterRequestDto : request body
LetterController --> ReissueLetterService
ReissueLetterService <|.. ReissueLetterServiceImpl
ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> SecurityUtil : authenticated login
ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> BulkPrintDataRepository : find latest pending record and delete
IReissueLetterRepository <|-- BulkPrintDataRepository
IReissueLetterRepository <|.. IReissueLetterRepositoryImpl
ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> JurorPoolUtils : request-information forms only
JurorPoolUtils --> SecurityUtil : current owner
JurorPoolUtils --> JurorPoolRepository : find active membership
ReissueLetterServiceImpl --> JurorHistoryService : request-information deletion history

note bottom of LetterController
  DELETE /api/v1/moj/letter/delete-pending-letter
  Bureau access required (@IsBureauUser)
  HTTP 200 with body "Letters reissued"
end note

note bottom of ReissueLetterServiceImpl
  Processes only the first letter in the request.
  Missing pending record throws NotFound.
  Pool lookup and history occur only for
  ENG_REQUESTINFO / BI_REQUESTINFO.
  Service entry method is transactional.
end note

legend bottom
  Only public methods relevant to this endpoint are shown.
  BulkPrintDataRepository inherits the lookup from IReissueLetterRepository.
  delete is inherited from Spring Data; its concrete entity type is shown.
  Spring Data composes the custom implementation into the repository.
  DTO accessors and private helper methods are omitted.
  No letters are reissued by this endpoint.
endlegend
